# tasks/g1_pick_place/record_demonstrations_v2.py (deterministic, see
# data/schema_v2.md). data/task1_prototype.hdf5 above is preserved
# unmodified as the original Phase 5B prototype evidence.
!data/task1_prototype_v2.hdf5

# Exception: Phase 5D's redesigned-policy-action dataset is small (~5.1MB)
